        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 690T, Tylo Apartment Door Lock Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Kwikset made door knob and deadbolt set is an excellent low cost replacement for apartments and homes. The classic design of the Tylo Knob is at home in any decor and will lend its graceful finish to any door while the deadbolt offers a single cylinder function. The 690T has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Tylo Door Knob with Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Thumb Turn <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Meets ADA Requirements</a></li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 Security</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt throw.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey system.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>5 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Tylo Knob Lock Set \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Projection: 31/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBoth locks (door knob lock and deadbolt lock) are keyed alike (use the same key). If ordering more than 1 lock set you can have each set Keyed Different or Keyed Alike.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Apartment Keyed Tylo Knob With Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Kwikset 690T",
                "description": "Kwikset 690T Keyed Tylo Knob With Single Cylinder Deadbolt - This Kwikset made door knob and deadbolt set is an excellent low cost replacement for apartments and homes. The classic design of the Tylo Knob is at home in any decor and will lend its graceful finish to any door while the deadbolt offers a single cylinder function. The 690T has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Adjustable for 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses.",
